// gti-test defaults for the single-file examples (tests/gti_test.cmake runs
// them as check-pass tests; examples carry no `//@` directives).
// --- 066-managed-threads.gti 076-scalar-atomics.gti 175-thread-local-storage.gti
// These examples are built with --execution-profile concurrent.
//@ execution-profile: concurrent
// --- 065-mutable-ranges.gti
// GTI-S2096 reports `samples` as never used mutably although the
// `for (mut auto& sample : samples)` loop writes through it: a compiler false
// positive for fixed arrays, tracked separately. Remove once it is fixed.
//@ allow-warnings
